   "date": "2026-10-28T06:39:16Z",
   "email": "person",
   "message": "Routes page: the all-routes chart leads, sorted by the gap, and picks the route below (#713)\n\nSeb, 28 Oct: the page was 12 repeated paragraphs and a separate calculator with no clear point. The\nall-routes chart we already had (dot this hour, 30 day range, line at the cheapest app) comes back as\nthe main thing, sorted by the dollar gap in each destination with the gap on each row, and tapping a\nrow opens that route's three existing charts below. The cards and the route button wall go once the\nwriter PR's words land. Opens on the biggest gap. No new charts.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KxKUVHG79PHMWt6bz1zpff\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>"
  },
  {
   "sha": "9abf69cccd1bf39f8595adf23bf08dc72ffebcd7",
   "html_url": "https://github.com/SebR214/margin/commit/9abf69cccd1bf39f8595adf23bf08dc72ffebcd7",
   "date": "2026-10-28T06:37:50Z",
   "email": "person",
   "message": "SEB-268: routes page words for the overview and the picked route (#714)\n\n* Routes overview words: heading, how to read it, the gap on each row, cheaper or more expensive\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KxKUVHG79PHMWt6bz1zpff\n\n* Routes: the picked route's headline and notes in plain words, shorter overview note\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KxKUVHG79PHMWt6bz1zpff\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>"
  },
